1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:02,200
First, he hurt the love of his life.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:02,640
Then he spent

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,789
the rest of his life protecting her son.

4
00:00:04,789 --> 00:00:06,890
At eleven, Severus Snape went to Hogwarts,

5
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,268
a hidden school of magic.

6
00:00:08,268 --> 00:00:09,940
Inside, a magic hat places students

7
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,130
in rival houses:

8
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,262
Gryffindor for the brave, Slytherin for the ambitious.

9
00:00:14,262 --> 00:00:16,090
As a lonely boy, he'd met Lily,

10
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,960
a girl from a non-magical family

11
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,412
who made flowers bloom.

12
00:00:19,412 --> 00:00:22,160
Lily became a Gryffindor, Severus a Slytherin.

13
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:22,880
They stayed friends,

14
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,744
but he drifted toward dark magic.

15
00:00:24,744 --> 00:00:27,410
James Potter, a Gryffindor bully, humiliated him.

16
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:28,556
Lily defended him.

17
00:00:28,556 --> 00:00:31,260
Some wizards despised children of non-magical parents,

18
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,749
and had a slur for them.

19
00:00:32,749 --> 00:00:33,860
To prove he didn't need her,

20
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,160
he called her that word.

21
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:35,837
Mudblood.

22
00:00:36,205 --> 00:00:37,320
She never forgave him.

23
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:38,404
She married James.

24
00:00:38,404 --> 00:00:39,860
Severus joined Voldemort,

25
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,612
the most feared dark wizard alive.

26
00:00:41,612 --> 00:00:43,320
He passed his master a prophecy,

27
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,547
then realized it meant Lily's baby son.

28
00:00:45,831 --> 00:00:48,419
He begged Dumbledore, the headmaster, to hide her.

29
00:00:48,419 --> 00:00:49,456
It wasn't enough.

30
00:00:49,846 --> 00:00:50,300
So he promised

31
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,986
to protect the boy with her eyes.

32
00:00:51,986 --> 00:00:54,040
But Harry had her eyes in James's face,

33
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:56,194
so he guarded him and tormented him.

34
00:00:56,194 --> 00:00:57,100
That explains it.

35
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,245
It doesn't excuse it.

36
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,860
Asked if he cared for the boy,

37
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,320
he conjured a silver doe,

38
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,325
a memory of Lily.

39
00:01:02,325 --> 00:01:03,451
After all this time?

40
00:01:03,903 --> 00:01:04,679
Always.

41
00:01:05,222 --> 00:01:07,280
Dying, he asked Harry for one last thing.

42
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:07,911
Look at me.

43
00:01:08,508 --> 00:01:09,340
Maybe so the last thing

44
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,241
he ever saw was her eyes.
